    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d550-a5">

                <pb facs="0663" n="577" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg577"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ton to Mr. Combs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Honored Sir</hi>: Referring to the note I had the
                    honor to address to your excellency on the 15th instant, I now have the pleasure
                    of making known to you that the fine illegally imposed upon me by the judge of
                    Amatitlan and of which I complained on the 11th ultimo has been returned to
                    me.</p>
                <p>I have the pleasure of once more repeating to you my most heartfelt thanks for
                    the happy termination of the affair, and repeat, etc.</p>
                <p>At the request of Juan Ton,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carlos Lon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
